{
  "id": "w20-ask-again",
  "titulo": "Ask until it's a number",
  "enunciado": "**Level ★★**\n\nKeep asking for a whole number until the user types only digits. Then print it **doubled**.\n\nPut any error message inside `input()`. Only print the final line.\n\nExample inputs: `abc`, `` (just Enter), `21`. The program prints:\n\n```text\nDouble: 42\n```",
  "codigo_inicial": "text = input(\"A whole number: \")\n\n",
  "usa_input": true,
  "entradas_ejemplo": "abc\n\n21",
